Comment:
 The binaries embed the web dashboards (web/frps/dist, web/frpc/dist),
 built from web/ and its npm dependencies at the versions in
 web/package-lock.json (Vue, Vue Router, Element Plus and their
 dependencies; MIT and similar permissive licenses). Go modules are
 vendored from go.sum; their licenses are in vendor/ in the source.

